  ('star-micronics-tsp654-usb', 'Star Micronics TSP654 USB', 'myeatOS', NULL, '[]', '<style type="text/css"><!--
td {border: 1px solid #ccc;}br {mso-data-placement:same-cell;}
--></style>
<p><span>Always leading, and always innovating, Star Micronics'' TSP654II high-speed thermal receipt printer is offered with a variety of interface options. Updated to further enhance one of Star''s most popular printers, the TSP654II boasts a lightning-fast print speed of 60 RPM (receipts per minute) and features an improved guillotine auto-cutter, and easy "Drop-In and Print" paper loading.</span></p>', 269, NULL, 'USD', 1, 'published', '2021-08-25T04:42:00-04:00', '2026-08-29T07:43:11-04:00'),
