<p><span>Always leading, and always innovating, Star Micronics'' TSP654II high-speed thermal receipt printer is offered with a variety of interface options. Updated to further enhance one of Star''s most popular printers, the TSP654II boasts a lightning-fast print speed of 60 RPM (receipts per minute) and features an improved guillotine auto-cutter, and easy "Drop-In and Print" paper loading.</span></p>', 289, NULL, 'USD', 1, 'published', '2021-08-25T04:40:37-04:00', '2026-08-29T07:43:11-04:00'),
